{"h":3396,"lines":[{"t":"Introduction","h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.11522633870442707,"c":1,"x":0.080246912823114233,"y":0.036337209169560958},{"x":0.079206377858226956,"h":0.020505606355880501,"w":0.08467984517415364,"y":0.080432821870134008,"c":1,"t":"Writing"},{"w":0.81492808024088548,"y":0.10561692580905635,"t":"This test consists of two tasks. It is suggested that candidates spend about 20 minutes on","x":0.080191162598916801,"h":0.018801616695660273,"c":1},{"w":0.80882985432942722,"x":0.08015997434393124,"t":"Task 1, which requires them to write at least 150 words, and 40 minutes on Task 2, which","c":1,"h":0.020146427221938379,"y":0.12301096251515797},{"x":0.080188597910117024,"y":0.14084761494253284,"c":1,"t":"requires them to write at least 250 words. Task 2 contributes twice as much as Task 1 to the","h":0.018344541039708284,"w":0.83138310750325517},{"c":1,"w":0.12854105631510415,"x":0.081828529199353239,"t":"Writing score.","y":0.16205648775303405,"h":0.015774436496873823},{"w":0.79847005208333333,"y":0.17693732587944033,"x":0.10282964705395954,"t":"Task 1 requires candidates to look at a diagram or some data (in a graph, table or chart)","c":1,"h":0.018076657968078558},{"h":0.019841925415470363,"y":0.1943772312492088,"x":0.082197549229097902,"w":0.78209655761718744,"c":1,"t":"and to present the information in their own words. They are assessed on their ability to"},{"t":"organise, present and possibly compare data, and are required to describe the stages of a","h":0.020583272963165533,"w":0.8170655314127605,"c":1,"y":0.21229269054318411,"x":0.082209426781235592},{"h":0.020755882397978542,"x":0.082142141664451843,"y":0.22966236398733386,"c":1,"w":0.64017105102539062,"t":"process, describe an object or event, or explain how something works."},{"c":1,"w":0.79845799763997405,"x":0.10078167303182965,"h":0.020098142545270981,"t":"In Task 2, candidates are presented with a point of view, argument or problem. They are","y":0.24838364512317845},{"w":0.83143793741861982,"c":1,"h":0.021101307953204418,"t":"assessed on their ability to present a solution to the problem, present and justify an opinion,","x":0.082219405853455788,"y":0.2657873155319096},{"w":0.84156377156575524,"t":"compare and contrast evidence and opinions, and to evaluate and challenge ideas, evidence","x":0.08230453392542017,"h":0.017667844522968101,"y":0.28474676066936588,"c":1},{"y":0.30523255786357084,"t":"or arguments.","x":0.082304526803862646,"h":0.014555427856804748,"w":0.12962963104248049,"c":1},{"y":0.31913060905771451,"h":0.019846029921892216,"x":0.10483407062317668,"t":"Candidates are also assessed on their ability to write in an appropriate style. More","w":0.74506154378255207,"c":1},{"t":"information on assessing the Writing test, including Writing assessment criteria (public","y":0.33711203004766233,"h":0.020179959713921281,"c":1,"w":0.78206288655598966,"x":0.080170022405350025},{"w":0.29629628499348959,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054074,"t":"version), is available at ielts.org.","x":0.082304532289095483,"y":0.35747938767636578},{"x":0.082042574419006892,"t":"Speaking","y":0.38725804398377683,"w":0.10546217600504557,"h":0.019088563143996429,"c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"This test takes between 11 and 14 minutes and is conducted by a trained examiner.","x":0.082304538013954126,"c":1,"y":0.41133720915473004,"w":0.75925923665364592},{"w":0.20205666859944665,"c":1,"y":0.43003016458251853,"h":0.016629937961609831,"t":"There are three parts:","x":0.08210925198046122},{"w":0.057613169352213556,"y":0.45930232542171034,"t":"Part 1","c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.084362139504963185},{"c":1,"t":"The candidate and the examiner introduce themselves. Candidates then answer general","y":0.47963222435670438,"w":0.80054748535156239,"x":0.084303482707005439,"h":0.018611238477367675},{"y":0.49618014917472375,"t":"questions about themselves, their home\/family, their job\/studies, their interests and a wide","c":1,"h":0.020991404008809167,"x":0.084229029830530447,"w":0.81505706787109367},{"h":0.019692046903468707,"t":"range of similar familiar topic areas. This part lasts between four and five minutes.","y":0.51391710158699822,"w":0.74504063924153641,"c":1,"x":0.082192259921366431},{"w":0.059670778910319008,"y":0.54651162774944506,"t":"Part 2","x":0.084362141306157365,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"x":0.084248539479631859,"y":0.56528543746101934,"h":0.019785677726754547,"c":1,"w":0.80676432291666667,"t":"The candidate is given a task card with prompts and is asked to talk on a particular topic."},{"x":0.084362131711757327,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"w":0.77983540852864575,"t":"The candidate has one minute to prepare and they can make some notes if they wish,","y":0.58421672555437465},{"w":0.78615722656249998,"t":"before speaking for between one and two minutes. The examiner then asks one or two","c":1,"x":0.084289011883498882,"y":0.60218999959164976,"h":0.018442988536102378},{"w":0.26567988077799481,"h":0.017311210767119167,"c":1,"t":"questions on the same topic.","x":0.084197989851388447,"y":0.62084098662529663},{"w":0.059670778910319008,"c":1,"y":0.65106007060623838,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Part 3","x":0.084362141309831676},{"c":1,"x":0.084276418814596549,"t":"The examiner and the candidate engage in a discussion of more abstract issues which are","y":0.6705266169356896,"w":0.81911265055338534,"h":0.019618502775266444},{"y":0.69040697659697192,"w":0.83950617472330735,"x":0.084362138943018763,"h":0.016012340046912876,"t":"thematically linked to the topic in Part 2. The discussion lasts between four and five minutes.","c":1},{"h":0.017927732007101849,"c":1,"t":"The Speaking test assesses whether candidates can communicate effectively in English.","y":0.70618335787219477,"x":0.10693989584977279,"w":0.80462025960286454},{"t":"The assessment takes into account Fluency and Coherence, Lexical Resource, Grammatical","h":0.019231056015679648,"x":0.084307852553043391,"c":1,"y":0.724787033944161,"w":0.84374720255533864},{"c":1,"x":0.086359291362038848,"t":"Range and Accuracy, and Pronunciation. More information on assessing the Speaking test,","w":0.82520355224609365,"y":0.74226865840880629,"h":0.018350766881756297},{"y":0.76017441879153536,"h":0.017505204298471022,"w":0.72427983601888024,"t":"including Speaking assessment criteria (public version), is available at ielts.org.","c":1,"x":0.082304529007020719},{"w":0.014403292338053389,"x":0.086419752905047387,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"6","y":0.91133720905395788}],"w":2400}